<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Lora:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.6.0/css/all.min.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/styles.css">
    <title>About Us - Al-Fatwa</title>
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('partials/header') %>

    <main class="main-content">
        <!-- About Hero Section -->
        <div class="list-hero animate-in">
            <div class="container">
                <span class="section-label">About the Platform</span>
                <h1 style="font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem); line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Scholarly Leadership</h1>
                <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); max-width: 800px; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.8;">
                    Al-Fatwa is dedicated to providing authentic Islamic jurisprudence and clarifying matters of faith for Yoruba-speaking Muslims globally, under the guidance of renowned scholars.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Biography & Details -->
        <div class="container animate-in" style="animation-delay: 0.1s; margin-bottom: 10rem;">
            <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 4rem; align-items: start;">
                
                <!-- Left: Scholar Bio -->
                <div class="course-card" style="padding: 4rem;">
                    <span class="section-label">Grand Mufti</span>
                    <h2 class="card-title" style="font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: white;">Fadeelatu-Sheikh Dhikrullahi Shafi'i</h2>
                    <p style="color: var(--primary); font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">
                        Grand Mufti, Conference of Islamic Organizations (CIO)
                    </p>
                    
                    <div style="font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-secondary); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem;">
                        <p style="font-style: italic; border-left: 3px solid var(--primary); padding-left: 1.5rem; color: var(--text-primary);">
                            "Awujo ti awa Musulumi Yoruba tin bere nipa awon oro esin Islam lati owo alfa-onimimo, oludajo-agba fun oro esin."
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            Sheikh Dhikrullah Shafi'i is a prominent Islamic scholar, deep legal thinker, and the Grand Mufti of the Conference of Islamic Organizations (CIO). 
                            He has dedicated his life to teaching, answering complex theological questions, and providing legal decrees (Fatwa) to guide the Muslim Ummah.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Right: Schedule & Links -->
                <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3rem;">
                    <!-- Card: Weekly Fatwah Session -->
                    <div class="course-card" style="padding: 3rem;">
                        <span class="section-label">Live Broadcasts</span>
                        <h3 class="card-title" style="font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Weekly Live Sessions</h3>
                        <p class="card-desc" style="font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
                            Our live Fatwah sessions are broadcasted directly to our community every week. Join us to ask questions and learn from the Sheikh.
                        </p>
                        
                        <div style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); border: 1px solid var(--border-glass); border-radius: 20px; padding: 2rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem;">
                            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-glass); padding-bottom: 1rem;">
                                <span style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-secondary);">Day</span>
                                <span style="font-weight: 700; color: white;">Every Wednesday</span>
                            </div>
                            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding-bottom: 0.5rem;">
                                <span style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-secondary);">Time</span>
                                <span style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary); font-size: 1.1rem;">8:30 PM</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Card: Facebook Stream Link -->
                    <div class="course-card" style="padding: 3rem; border-color: var(--primary);">
                        <span class="section-label">Watch Live</span>
                        <h3 class="card-title" style="font-size: 1.6rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Facebook Lectures Page</h3>
                        <p class="card-desc" style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
                            Access the live streams, video library, and regular lectures directly on Sheikh Shafi'i's official educational page.
                        </p>
                        <a href="https://www.facebook.com/" target="_blank" class="btn btn-primary" style="width: 100%; display: inline-flex; justify-content: center; gap: 1rem; font-size: 1rem;">
                            <i class="fa-brands fa-facebook-f"></i>
                            <span>Go to Facebook Page</span>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
